00:52:31.690 --> 00:52:32.560
Hey! Can't you hear that sound?

00:52:33.340 --> 00:52:34.600
Get out of here!

00:52:35.340 --> 00:52:35.920
You're all dead!

00:52:36.920 --> 00:52:37.840
I don't want to die.

00:52:37.920 --> 00:52:38.280
What's with the camera?

00:52:38.800 --> 00:52:39.020
That's right.

00:52:39.460 --> 00:52:41.670
There's nothing that can stop us.

00:52:42.450 --> 00:52:43.090
Let's dance!

00:52:43.990 --> 00:52:44.530
Come on!

00:52:44.670 --> 00:52:46.130
Dance for the sake of your parents!

00:52:46.970 --> 00:52:48.510
Your father and mother...

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:29.980
Thank you.

00:53:32.076 --> 00:53:32.336
All right.

00:54:03.040 --> 00:54:03.460
the driver went to heaven

00:55:30.280 --> 00:55:35.670
Stop it! Don't do anything bad!

00:56:10.360 --> 00:56:10.700
Don't you know?

00:56:10.900 --> 00:56:11.620
No, I don't.

00:56:32.110 --> 00:56:35.710
Mr. Hidaka, please leave the JIT Plan to us scientists.

00:56:36.690 --> 00:56:42.200
However, you are the one who knows the most about Gamera.

00:56:43.400 --> 00:56:47.180
We don't need any help from you.

00:56:47.180 --> 00:56:50.120
We will support you with science and technology from all over the world.

00:56:51.060 --> 00:56:51.840
Thank you very much.

00:56:52.040 --> 00:56:55.560
I would like to thank you from the bottom of my heart as a Japanese.

00:56:55.680 --> 00:56:59.890
However, the JIT Plan is 24 hours...

00:57:00.120 --> 00:57:02.260
If it doesn't, it won't be completed.

00:57:02.780 --> 00:57:05.840
The problem is what to do with the Gamera by then.

00:57:06.420 --> 00:57:08.380
That's from the perspective of animal science.

00:57:09.780 --> 00:57:12.320
I think the reason why the Gamera is rampant is because of the lack of energy.

00:57:14.260 --> 00:57:20.590
Currently, the Gamera is sitting in the oil combine and sucking in the flame of the object.

00:57:21.370 --> 00:57:25.650
According to calculations, the oil there will burn out in 8 hours.

00:57:26.770 --> 00:57:29.200
Mr. Hinaka.

00:57:30.160 --> 00:57:34.020
The best way to stop the damage is to lock the glamera in there.

00:57:34.600 --> 00:57:35.180
That's right.

00:57:35.500 --> 00:57:40.580
Besides, there's no other way but to distribute the oil from the outside so that the flames continue to burn.

00:58:26.840 --> 00:58:27.600
They'll kill us all.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:30.900
Roger that.

00:59:11.230 --> 00:59:12.390
Hello, this is Konbinato.

00:59:12.550 --> 00:59:13.640
Oh, Mr. Hidaka.

00:59:14.040 --> 00:59:14.880
Yes, sir.

00:59:16.380 --> 00:59:17.980
Everyone, you have 24 hours left.

00:59:17.980 --> 00:59:19.620
All you have to do is refuel and do your best.

00:59:19.780 --> 00:59:20.540
Do your best!

00:59:20.880 --> 00:59:21.620
Yes, sir!

00:59:27.030 --> 00:59:27.550
24 hours!

01:00:31.340 --> 01:00:31.580
We'll be right back.

01:01:01.240 --> 01:01:01.460
Ouyang

01:01:37.760 --> 01:01:47.620
The latest technology in the world, the Oshima JIT plan, has just been completed.

01:01:50.040 --> 01:01:56.680
But the problem is how to lead Gamera to Oshima.

01:01:56.680 --> 01:01:57.500
I don't know how long it will take.

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:02.300
Even if the plan is well-planned, the camera won't be able to reach Ooshima.

01:02:05.180 --> 01:02:07.320
I have an idea.

01:02:08.850 --> 01:02:09.650
Please, Mr. Hidaka.

01:02:10.420 --> 01:02:13.610
How can we get the camera to Ooshima?

01:02:16.240 --> 01:02:21.360
The Z-Project was finally launched.

01:02:22.260 --> 01:02:24.110
The refugees began to evacuate.

01:02:24.130 --> 01:02:27.770
The mass media and the public were banned from entering.

01:02:32.880 --> 01:02:34.320
I've been separated from Aoyama for a long time.

01:02:34.660 --> 01:02:35.850
It's terrible that I'm the only one left out of the three survivors.

01:02:39.120 --> 01:02:40.800
But the media people won't go to Oshima.

01:02:41.680 --> 01:02:42.700
Well, I'll give it up.

01:02:43.480 --> 01:02:46.100
It's a farewell to the goddess of my destiny.

01:02:46.640 --> 01:02:47.570
It's a shame.

01:02:47.830 --> 01:02:50.140
Dr. Murasawa is there.

01:02:50.260 --> 01:02:51.320
Go to Kawasaki.

01:02:51.760 --> 01:02:53.250
You should be able to do your research there.

01:02:54.110 --> 01:02:54.940
See you.

01:03:30.092 --> 01:03:31.092
Did you go to Oshima?

01:03:31.092 --> 01:03:31.592
Yes.

01:03:32.172 --> 01:03:34.272
All that's left is to send the necessary equipment.

01:03:34.892 --> 01:03:37.692
Tell the camera guy to go to Oshima.

01:03:38.060 --> 01:03:40.060
Thank you for watching.

01:04:02.430 --> 01:04:02.690
I'm sorry to bother you.

01:04:03.580 --> 01:04:06.810
What's wrong with Nobuyo-san?

01:04:07.510 --> 01:04:10.780
Yes, well, he was about to be disbanded for Ichioji's plan,

01:04:12.400 --> 01:04:13.580
but Toshio suddenly disappeared.

01:04:14.820 --> 01:04:17.280
He always talked about Gamera,

01:04:18.300 --> 01:04:19.760
so I thought he might be here.

01:04:20.300 --> 01:04:21.280
Toshio-kun?

01:04:21.500 --> 01:04:21.720
Yes.

01:04:21.820 --> 01:04:28.460
Excuse me.

01:04:28.520 --> 01:04:28.780
Yes.

01:04:30.090 --> 01:04:30.350
Yes, sir.

01:04:30.820 --> 01:04:32.300
The final equipment for the Z Project has arrived.

01:04:32.660 --> 01:04:33.720
Please go to the temporary headquarters on the coast.

01:04:34.020 --> 01:04:34.520
Yes, sir.

01:04:35.530 --> 01:04:35.950
Excuse me, sir.

01:04:36.590 --> 01:04:36.830
Yes, sir.

01:04:36.950 --> 01:04:49.300
This is the first stage of the Z Project.

01:04:50.820 --> 01:04:51.660
It's no use.

01:04:52.180 --> 01:04:53.590
Why is the truck still here?

01:04:53.870 --> 01:04:54.390
What's wrong?

01:04:54.770 --> 01:04:56.700
Sir, it's a three-car train.

01:04:57.020 --> 01:04:57.870
A three-car train?

01:04:58.770 --> 01:04:59.800
Well, what can we do?

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:04.080
I'm worried about Gamera.

01:05:06.880 --> 01:05:10.420
Toshio, don't get in the way.

01:05:11.370 --> 01:05:13.690
Let's go over there.

01:05:16.680 --> 01:05:18.720
Let's get started.

01:05:18.960 --> 01:05:22.910
Mr. Hidaka, can we really call Gamera here?

01:05:24.310 --> 01:05:27.600
Of course. The typhoon is approaching, so we have to do it before that.

01:05:30.600 --> 01:05:33.330
Hello, this is Oshima. We're starting the Z-plan.

01:05:34.850 --> 01:05:38.980
Hurry up! Hurry up!

01:05:39.140 --> 01:05:39.620
Where are you going?

01:05:40.300 --> 01:05:53.230
Get in!

01:05:53.570 --> 01:05:53.990
Ready!

01:06:03.120 --> 01:06:07.670
Nobuya-san, Toshio-kun is protected in Oshima.

01:06:09.160 --> 01:06:10.420
That's great.

01:06:11.220 --> 01:06:28.520
Hello, this is Oshima.

01:06:30.800 --> 01:06:33.650
The tanker is here. Doctor, please.

01:06:34.380 --> 01:06:36.460
Yes, I understand. Please.

01:07:30.600 --> 01:07:40.700
We did it! The Gamera is passing right in front of us!

01:07:40.960 --> 01:07:45.060
Understood. Everyone, the Gamera is coming this way.

01:07:45.740 --> 01:07:49.740
Hello? Hello? Yes, understood.

01:07:50.060 --> 01:07:51.520
The preparations are complete.

01:07:57.860 --> 01:07:59.120
Doctor, is he here?

01:07:59.440 --> 01:07:59.640
Yes.

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:05.190
I'll tell you the typhoon information.

01:08:06.090 --> 01:08:08.650
The typhoon that occurred in the east of Otorijima

01:08:08.650 --> 01:08:12.210
has taken the route to the north and is approaching the main island at high speed.

01:08:12.690 --> 01:08:15.340
The center of gravity is 960 millibars.

01:08:15.520 --> 01:08:17.310
The maximum wind speed is 50 meters.

01:08:17.650 --> 01:08:19.290
The characteristics of this typhoon are...

01:08:19.290 --> 01:08:21.390
Mr. Hidaka, what should we do?

01:08:22.050 --> 01:08:23.770
If you could just land, it would be ours.

01:08:24.510 --> 01:08:26.540
The camera! The camera is here!

01:09:34.030 --> 01:09:34.250
It's an emergency.

01:09:34.750 --> 01:09:36.700
We came all the way here.

01:09:37.570 --> 01:09:39.800
Mr. Hidaka, what if we use the mechanism we used in the Z project?

01:09:41.960 --> 01:09:42.920
We can't do that.

01:09:42.920 --> 01:09:47.750
But if we do that, we'll run out of fuel and it won't be possible to realize the Z project.

01:10:09.950 --> 01:10:14.000
Hey, are you crazy?

01:10:14.240 --> 01:10:16.360
Are you trying to kill me?

01:10:16.920 --> 01:10:18.280
No, I'm not.

01:10:18.660 --> 01:10:20.200
I'm not allowed to enter this island.

01:10:21.300 --> 01:10:22.960
I wanted to help you,

01:10:23.920 --> 01:10:25.320
so I got involved in the Impli.

01:10:25.480 --> 01:10:27.030
I was working for the Kagenawa Z Project.

01:10:28.490 --> 01:10:29.690
But it's impossible to set fire to it.

01:10:30.830 --> 01:10:34.890
No, we'll make the fire bigger and make it even bigger.

01:10:35.510 --> 01:10:38.930
We like fire, so we'll make it land on the target.

01:10:39.570 --> 01:10:39.810
I see.

01:10:42.620 --> 01:10:44.740
Everyone, light the fire!

01:11:36.360 --> 01:11:37.820
Oh my God.

01:12:05.470 --> 01:12:06.110
I did as much as I could.

01:12:06.390 --> 01:12:07.410
You can't win against your natural power.

01:12:08.670 --> 01:12:10.640
Damn it! It's so suspicious!

01:12:42.600 --> 01:12:43.280
Oh

01:13:23.870 --> 01:13:23.970
This is the plan.

01:13:32.940 --> 01:13:52.600
I'm sorry, I'll be late for the test plan.

01:14:02.430 --> 01:14:02.830
Amazing!

01:14:03.290 --> 01:14:06.850
You're not going to save me, are you?

01:14:37.260 --> 01:14:39.640
Congratulations, Taka. You've done a good job.

01:14:39.920 --> 01:14:40.420
Thank you.

01:14:46.040 --> 01:14:56.770
We'll start Operation Z. First step.

01:16:09.120 --> 01:16:09.460
Hard step!

01:16:09.680 --> 01:16:15.840
Set plan!

01:16:16.000 --> 01:16:17.080
Start on the second day!

01:16:17.340 --> 01:16:19.590
Tee-

01:16:19.590 --> 01:16:20.980
A-

01:16:30.280 --> 01:16:35.430
Three, two, one, zero.

01:17:09.150 --> 01:17:11.770
Everyone in the world, everyone in the world,

01:17:11.830 --> 01:17:14.400
we have gathered all the science and technology in the world.

01:17:16.000 --> 01:17:18.700
The Z-Plan's Mars-to-Earth rocket was completed here,

01:17:18.700 --> 01:17:20.770
and the Gamera was launched successfully.

01:17:22.060 --> 01:17:22.480
The last plan of mankind,

01:17:22.480 --> 01:17:22.540
which was to send the Gamera,

01:17:22.540 --> 01:17:23.480
which was not killed on Earth,

01:17:23.480 --> 01:17:25.770
into Mars where there were no living things,

01:17:26.570 --> 01:17:27.570
was a success.

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:33.810
He was able to succeed thanks to his love for humanity.

01:17:34.030 --> 01:17:38.360
Mr. Hidaka, congratulations.

01:17:39.020 --> 01:17:39.480
Thank you.

01:17:39.640 --> 01:17:41.190
Mr. Hidaka, congratulations.

01:17:42.700 --> 01:17:45.940
Mr. Yawato, don't forget about the research.

01:17:47.100 --> 01:17:49.690
Be the goddess of Aoyama.

01:17:49.870 --> 01:17:50.970
Yes, sir.

01:17:51.270 --> 01:17:51.650
I'm sorry.

01:17:54.230 --> 01:17:56.790
Toshio, aren't you lonely with Gamera gone?

01:17:58.070 --> 01:17:59.340
I'm not lonely, sir.

01:18:00.830 --> 01:18:03.110
I'm going to meet a science scientist like you.
